<description>&lt;p&gt;Gold smuggling is now reported to be financing an Islamic State-linked insurgency in eastern DRC, with gold flowing through Uganda to support rebels, according to Sentry. Ebola cases have surpassed 10,000 and a nurse treating patients was killed by a mob, while a health worker was wounded, prompting Uganda to tighten its border. Rebel forces continue to capture weapons from fleeing DRC and Burundian troops and the DRC army has recaptured strategic territory from a rebel group led by an ex-president. The conflict produced 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNMnhvbmdWV1pFaFhQNzVCM0JidlBvYTVSd2ppOENPdjVxT2tYcFA2c1ZjR2FIQ0I5VGtVUmo1SHBXWGJtRFhSXzdWd0Q0bjFLU0ZhdUxzb0pGSWRINFZYWUxmWFhERV9GMHA5SXN5WDQ5WVhPTHVVNmVfU2U3RDJJTC1WYVBFRGx3ZHVHMW41SnpsR0hkVGhUYkF0UGdfV0JsSVFBYUpsMDR5ZnNRV29Lb0h6bEthakZXSHpULURjZk1VNllvRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOZ09fX1dBT200aVBYSWJ0ZDBndWQyWlA2RkVuclhtMEs0dlpFemtoTGpmWVFxREh2MXZWT29fSnhyUks5TXlyaXhEdW9jVjhlS2tWYkZ1Z2QyQS1aaU9FaEFLakoxQ3RCMzltb2xldkJ4UzNDRWRKM21VWXgtSXp2UlhDbkM1Vkx1emhmajZScWVHUkVmM0tMejZnTUhqV3NNY1BqS0hKem9tUDFyeU1lMGJ0VWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA0UHltUWxpb2RGV3hhRTZzdXRKLXZlcktvOE5ZeE1nX0JNaGF0Nm92bzlFamI1TlJGWXlNRjdPWkh6UXZuNTN1Z3BNeHlfYnI1SzB2OEpFMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OMkE2ckFEdi04enBjZXVsekphLTVqVkRacVdKMzhuQ1RrNHByZjFOOEkxbEd5akFXUVdlV1hnWkRaN056RHRuRUtQYUIwYVk0Q1pqTFRuVUI5WXV3cEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Ja